00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:25.130
But as you pace
through, if you look

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.546
through the different
markets, you

00:10:26.546 --> 00:10:28.880
see that over the
course of this year,

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:32.524
Bigtable will start to show
up in more and more locations.

00:10:32.524 --> 00:10:33.940
It's super important
that you know

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.530
that we're bringing
all of GCP to you

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:37.950
in each one of these locations.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.830
So we're working through
our product list,

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.740
prioritizing and
regionalizing as much of GCP

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.960
as we can as quickly as
possible to make sure

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:47.862
that every region you pick is
a consistent user experience.

00:10:47.862 --> 00:10:49.820
NEAL MUELLER: We do these
