00:15:03.310 --> 00:15:07.540
in addition to these
slides is like a tool

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:08.800
that you all can use.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.249
It's called gcping.com.

00:15:10.249 --> 00:15:12.790
Let me make this a little bit
bigger so you guys can read it.

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.550
So this is a website that
shows you which region might

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:16.850
be best for you.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.790
Now, you might pick
best based on cost,

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:21.010
but you might pick
best based on speed.

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:23.800
And all the advancements that
Google does around our network,

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:25.508
we still can't adjust
the speed of light.

00:15:25.508 --> 00:15:26.420
It is what it is.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.720
And so the physically
closest region to you

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.970
is going to be the
fastest response time.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:33.310
And this tool is a way for
you to figure that out.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:34.700
So let's do a race.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:36.730
Let's click here, and
